const __blk0=staticBlock(staticMarkup(' <div class="page"> <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">Entity Grid</h1> <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro"> <code>&lt;pdx-entity-grid&gt;</code> — a CRUD surface that composes <code>pdx-data-grid</code> +\\n      a "New" toolbar + per-row edit/delete + a bulk-actions bar + <code>pdx-edit-drawer</code>.\\n      It keeps a local optimistic copy of the rows and emits\\n      <code>pdx-create</code>/<code>pdx-update</code>/<code>pdx-delete</code> so you can persist.\\n    </p>  <app-demo-comp-entity-grid-full-crud class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-entity-grid-full-crud>  <app-demo-comp-entity-grid-read-only class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-entity-grid-read-only>  <section> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Props</h2> <table class="options-table"><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>columns</code></td><td>ColumnDef[]</td><td>[]</td><td>Grid columns. An edit/delete actions column is appended unless readonly.</td></tr><tr><td><code>data</code></td><td>object[]</td><td>[]</td><td>Entity rows.</td></tr><tr><td><code>schema</code></td><td>FormSchema</td><td>null</td><td>Form schema for the create/edit drawer. Omit → no CRUD affordances.</td></tr><tr><td><code>idField</code></td><td>string</td><td>\\'id\\'</td><td>Row identity field.</td></tr><tr><td><code>selection</code></td><td>none|single|multiple</td><td>multiple</td><td>Row selection mode.</td></tr><tr><td><code>rowActions</code></td><td>boolean</td><td>true</td><td>Show the per-row edit/delete column.</td></tr><tr><td><code>bulkActions</code></td><td>BulkAction[]</td><td>[]</td><td>Extra bulk actions (besides Delete).</td></tr><tr><td><code>readonly</code></td><td>boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Hide all mutating affordances.</td></tr><tr><td><code>confirmDelete</code></td><td>boolean</td><td>true</td><td>Ask before deleting ("Delete Alice Johnson?", "Delete 2 records?"). <code>false</code> when your <code>pdx-delete</code> handler confirms or offers undo.</td></tr><tr><td><code>rowLabel</code></td><td>string</td><td>\\'\\'</td><td>Field that names a row in its Edit/Delete buttons and the confirmation. Empty: the first text column.</td></tr></tbody></table> <table class="options-table" style="margin-top: var(--pdx-space-lg);"><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>pdx-create</code></td><td>{ values, clientId } — <code>clientId</code> is the optimistic row\\'s local id (use it to reconcile after persisting)</td></tr><tr><td><code>pdx-update</code></td><td>{ id, values }</td></tr><tr><td><code>pdx-delete</code></td><td>{ ids, rows? }</td></tr><tr><td><code>pdx-bulk</code></td><td>{ key, ids } — for custom bulk actions</td></tr></tbody></table> </section> </div> '));
