const __blk0=staticBlock(staticMarkup(' <div class="page"> <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">File Upload</h1> <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro"> <code>&lt;pdx-file-upload&gt;</code> — drag-and-drop file upload with validation, image preview, size/count limits.\\n      Supports accept filters, custom labels, and sizes. Auto-upload requires a server endpoint (not demoed here).\\n    </p>  <app-demo-comp-file-upload-basic class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-file-upload-basic>  <app-demo-comp-file-upload-image-only class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-file-upload-image-only>  <app-demo-comp-file-upload-size-limit class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-file-upload-size-limit>  <app-demo-comp-file-upload-max-files class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-file-upload-max-files>  <app-demo-comp-file-upload-custom-label class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-file-upload-custom-label>  <app-demo-comp-file-upload-sizes class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-file-upload-sizes>  <app-demo-comp-file-upload-disabled class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-file-upload-disabled>  <section> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Slots</h2> <div class="options-table"> <table><thead><tr><th>Slot</th><th>Scope</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>file</code></td><td><code>{ file, status, progress }</code></td><td>Custom file item content.</td></tr></tbody></table> </div> </section>  <section> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Props Reference</h2> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Prop</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>accept</code><span>string</span><span>Accepted file types (e.g. "image/*", ".pdf,.doc")</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>multiple</code><span>boolean</span><span>Allow selecting multiple files</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>maxSize</code><span>number</span><span>Max file size in bytes (0 = no limit)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>maxFiles</code><span>number</span><span>Max number of files (0 = no limit)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>disabled</code><span>boolean</span><span>Disable interaction</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>label</code><span>string</span><span>Drop zone text (default: "Drop files here or click to browse")</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>name</code><span>string</span><span>Form field name for upload (default: "file")</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>auto</code><span>boolean</span><span>Auto-upload on select (requires action URL)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>action</code><span>string</span><span>Upload endpoint URL</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>size</code><span>string</span><span>Drop zone size: sm, (default), lg</span></div> </div> </section>  <section> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Events Reference</h2> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Event</span><span>Detail</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-select</code><span>{ files: File[] }</span><span>Files passed validation and were added</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-error</code><span>{ file, error }</span><span>File rejected (size limit or type mismatch)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-remove</code><span>{ file, index }</span><span>File removed from the list</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-upload</code><span>{ file }</span><span>Upload started (auto mode)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-progress</code><span>{ file, percent }</span><span>Upload progress update</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-success</code><span>{ file, response }</span><span>Upload completed successfully</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Exposed Methods</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Method</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row-2"><code>addFiles(files)</code><span>Programmatically add files</span></div> <div class="opt-row-2"><code>removeFile(index)</code><span>Remove file at index</span></div> <div class="opt-row-2"><code>uploadAll()</code><span>Trigger upload for all pending files</span></div> <div class="opt-row-2"><code>clear()</code><span>Remove all files and abort uploads</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Keyboard</h3> <div class="shortcut-list"> <div><kbd>Enter</kbd> / <kbd>Space</kbd> Open file browser (when drop zone focused)</div> <div><kbd>Delete</kbd> / <kbd>Backspace</kbd> Remove file (when file item focused)</div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Accessibility</h3> <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">\\n        Drop zone has <code>role="button"</code> with <code>tabindex="0"</code> and <code>aria-label</code>\\n        matching the label prop. <code>aria-disabled</code> is set when disabled.\\n        File list uses <code>role="list"</code> with <code>role="listitem"</code> on each entry.\\n        Remove buttons have <code>aria-label="Remove"</code>. Progress bars use <code>role="progressbar"</code>\\n        with <code>aria-valuenow</code>.\\n      </p> </section> </div> '));
