const __blk0=staticBlock(staticMarkup(' <div class="page"> <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">Form System</h1> <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro"> <code>&lt;pdx-form&gt;</code> — compound form with validation, save modes, schema-driven templates, and DataSource integration.\\n      Each control binds its field through its model, <code>::value="form.email"</code>, and <code>&lt;pdx-form-field :field&gt;</code> shows the field\\'s error.\\n    </p>  <app-demo-comp-form-basic class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-basic>  <app-demo-comp-form-nested-dto class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-nested-dto>  <app-demo-comp-form-validation-modes class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-validation-modes>  <app-demo-comp-form-warning-rules class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-warning-rules>  <app-demo-comp-form-programmatic class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-programmatic>  <app-demo-comp-form-data-source class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-data-source>  <app-demo-comp-form-form-template class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-form-template>  <app-demo-comp-form-all-controls class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-form-all-controls>  <section> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Reference</h2> <h3 class="pdx-txt-small pdx-weight-semibold" style="margin-bottom: var(--pdx-space-sm)">pdx-form Props</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Prop</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>form</code><span>Form</span><span>Form instance from createForm() or @form rune</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>name</code><span>string</span><span>Name for nested form registration</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>autocomplete</code><span>string</span><span>HTML autocomplete attribute (default: \\'off\\')</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>scrollToError</code><span>boolean</span><span>Scroll to first error on failed validation (default: true)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>source</code><span>DataSource</span><span>DataSource for auto-load/save (Phase D)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>recordId</code><span>string</span><span>Record ID to load from DataSource</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-small pdx-weight-semibold" style="margin-top: var(--pdx-space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--pdx-space-sm)">pdx-field-group Props</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Prop</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>name</code><span>string</span><span>Nested object key — scopes child field paths</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>label</code><span>string</span><span>Optional fieldset legend</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>display</code><span>string</span><span>\\'inline\\' (default) | \\'dialog\\' | \\'panel\\' (Phase E)</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-small pdx-weight-semibold" style="margin-top: var(--pdx-space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--pdx-space-sm)">pdx-field-list Props</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Prop</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>name</code><span>string</span><span>Array field name in the form</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>label</code><span>string</span><span>Label above the list</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>itemFields</code><span>array</span><span>Field definitions per array item</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>itemDefault</code><span>object</span><span>Default values for new items</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>minItems</code><span>number</span><span>Minimum items (default: 0)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>maxItems</code><span>number</span><span>Maximum items (default: 999)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>addLabel</code><span>string</span><span>Add button text (default: \\'+ Add\\')</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>removable</code><span>boolean</span><span>Allow removing items (default: true)</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-small pdx-weight-semibold" style="margin-top: var(--pdx-space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--pdx-space-sm)">createForm() Config</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Option</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>initialValues</code><span>T</span><span>Initial field values object</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>validators</code><span>object</span><span>Per-field sync validators</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>asyncValidators</code><span>object</span><span>Per-field async validators</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>validateOn</code><span>string</span><span>\\'onChange\\' | \\'onBlur\\' | \\'onSubmit\\' (default: \\'onBlur\\')</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>saveMode</code><span>string</span><span>\\'onSubmit\\' | \\'onChange\\' | \\'onBlur\\' | \\'immediate\\'</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>saveDebounce</code><span>number</span><span>Debounce ms for onChange/immediate (default: 500)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>warnings</code><span>object</span><span>Per-field warning validators (non-blocking)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>fieldConfig</code><span>object</span><span>Per-field save mode overrides</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>warnUnsaved</code><span>boolean</span><span>Navigation guard for unsaved changes</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>schema</code><span>StandardSchema</span><span>External schema (Zod, Valibot, ArkType)</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-small pdx-weight-semibold" style="margin-top: var(--pdx-space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--pdx-space-sm)">Form Instance API</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Method/Signal</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>fields</code><span>object</span><span>Per-field accessors: value, error, warning, touched, dirty, onChange, onBlur</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>valid</code><span>Signal&l