g</td></tr><tr><td><code>fallback</code></td><td>String</td><td>\\'\\'</td><td>Fallback image URL on error</td></tr><tr><td><code>fallback-icon</code></td><td>String</td><td>\\'image-off\\'</td><td>Icon name shown on error</td></tr><tr><td><code>placeholder</code></td><td>String</td><td>\\'skeleton\\'</td><td>Placeholder: skeleton | blur | none</td></tr><tr><td><code>ratio</code></td><td>String</td><td>\\'\\'</td><td>Aspect ratio (e.g. \\'16/9\\', \\'1/1\\')</td></tr><tr><td><code>rounded</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Circular border-radius (50%)</td></tr><tr><td><code>radius</code></td><td>String</td><td>\\'\\'</td><td>Custom border-radius value</td></tr><tr><td><code>zoomable</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Click to toggle 2x zoom</td></tr><tr><td><code>lightbox</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Click opens fullscreen overlay</td></tr><tr><td><code>caption</code></td><td>String</td><td>\\'\\'</td><td>Caption text below image</td></tr><tr><td><code>auth-src</code></td><td>String</td><td>\\'\\'</td><td>URL requiring authentication (fetched via fetch + objectURL)</td></tr><tr><td><code>:auth-provider</code></td><td>Function</td><td>null</td><td>() =&gt; Record&lt;string,string&gt; returning HTTP headers</td></tr><tr><td><code>:fetch-fn</code></td><td>Function</td><td>null</td><td>(url: string) =&gt; Promise&lt;Blob&gt; for custom fetching</td></tr></tbody></table> </div> </section>  <section> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Events</h2> <div class="options-table"> <table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Detail</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>pdx-load</code></td><td>{}</td><td>Emitted when image loads successfully</td></tr><tr><td><code>pdx-error</code></td><td>{}</td><td>Emitted when image fails to load</td></tr><tr><td><code>pdx-zoom</code></td><td>{ zoomed: boolean }</td><td>Emitted on zoom toggle</td></tr></tbody></table> </div> </section> </div> '));
