'click\\' (default) | \\'dblclick\\' | \\'icon\\'</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>saveOn</code><span>string</span><span>\\'blur\\' (default, auto-save) | \\'action\\' (confirm/cancel buttons)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>currency</code><span>string</span><span>Currency code for type=currency (default: EUR)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>placeholder</code><span>string</span><span>Text when value is empty</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>showIcon</code><span>boolean</span><span>Show edit pencil icon on hover (default: true)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>label</code><span>string</span><span>The field\\'s name, for the editor\\'s accessible name (default: "Edit {value}")</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>disabled</code><span>boolean</span><span>Disabled state</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>readonly</code><span>boolean</span><span>Readonly state</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Events</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Event</span><span>Detail</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>value-change</code><span>{ value }</span><span>Value confirmed (Enter, blur, or button); <code>::value</code> binds it both ways</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-cancel</code><span>—</span><span>Edit cancelled (Escape or cancel button)</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Methods</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Method</span><span>—</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>startEdit()</code><span></span><span>Open the editor, as a click does; nothing while disabled or readonly</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>confirmEdit() / cancelEdit()</code><span></span><span>Save and close / close and keep the value (emits <code>pdx-cancel</code>)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>focus() / blur()</code><span></