tring</span><span>Field for value (default: \\'value\\')</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>descriptionField</code><span>string</span><span>Optional field for description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>minLength</code><span>number</span><span>Min chars after trigger before searching</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>debounce</code><span>number</span><span>Debounce ms for remote search (default: 300)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>maxItems</code><span>number</span><span>Max suggestions shown (default: 10)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>rows</code><span>number</span><span>Textarea rows (default: 3)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>disabled</code><span>boolean</span><span>Disabled state</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>readonly</code><span>boolean</span><span>Readonly state</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Events</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Event</span><span>Detail</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-select</code><span>{ item, trigger, query }</span><span>Mention item selected</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>value-change</code><span>{ value }</span><span>Its model: the text changed</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>change</code><span>—</span><span>The commit, a native event: on blur after typing, and when a mention is picked</span></div> </div> <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Methods</h3> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Method</span><span>Returns</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>getMentionMarkup()</code><span>string</span><span>The text with each mention as <code>@[Label](id)</code>: the form to persist</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>getMentions()</code><span>array</span><span>The mentions in the text: <code>{ value, label, trigger }</code> each</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><