itle, message, size (sm, md, lg, xl)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>dialog.closeAll()</code><span>—</span><span>Closes every dialog in the queue</span></div> </div> <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted note">The outlet itself has no props: it draws the page\\'s queue.</p> </section>  <pdx-overlay-outlet></pdx-overlay-outlet> </div> '));
