ype</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>value</code><span>string</span><span><code>HH:mm</code> or <code>HH:mm:ss</code>, 24-hour; empty for no time</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>format</code><span>string</span><span>auto (default), 12h, 24h</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>showSeconds</code><span>boolean</span><span>Adds the seconds segment</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>step</code><span>number</span><span>Minutes (and seconds) per arrow press</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>min / max</code><span>string</span><span>Range, <code>HH:mm</code></span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>size</code><span>string</span><span>sm, (default), lg</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>locale</code><span>string</span><span>Locale for <code>format="auto"</code></span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>disabled</code><span>boolean</span><span>Disabled state</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>name</code><span>string</span><span>Form field name (form-associated)</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>value-change</code><span>event</span><span>Its model: <code>detail.value</code>, the new value</span></div> </div> </section> </div> '));
