tiple selection</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>*</code><span>Opens every sibling of the focused node</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>a–z</code><span>Type-ahead: jumps to the next node starting with what you typed</span></div> </div> </section>  <section> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Props</h2> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Prop</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>nodes</code><span>array</span><span>The roots</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>idField</code><span>string</span><span>Field identifying a node — <code>id</code></span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>labelField</code><span>string</span><span>Field rendered as text — <code>label</code></span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>childrenField</code><span>string</span><span>Field holding the children — <code>children</code></span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>selectionMode</code><span>string</span><span>none (default), single, multiple</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>checkable</code><span>boolean</span><span>A checkbox per node, tri-state over a branch</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>defaultExpandAll</code><span>boolean</span><span>Open every branch on first render</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>loadChildren</code><span>function</span><span><code>(node) =&gt; Promise&lt;Node[]&gt;</code>, called the first time a branch opens</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>label</code><span>string</span><span>Accessible name for the tree</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>disabled</code><span>boolean</span><span>Readable, not operable</span></div> </div> <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Events</h2> <div class="options-table"> <div class="opt-header"><span>Event</span><span>Detail</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-select</code><span><code>{ selected: string[] }</code> — the ids selected, after the change</span></div> <div class="opt-row"><code>pdx-expand</co